Record token usage on an LLM span. Which input/output token keys are used for cost estimation?

```python
@llm(model_name="gpt-5.1", model_provider="openai")
def call_model(messages):
    resp = client.chat.completions.create(model="gpt-5.1", messages=messages)
    LLMObs.annotate(
        metrics={
            "[A]": resp.usage.prompt_tokens,
            "[B]": resp.usage.completion_tokens,
            "total_tokens": resp.usage.total_tokens,
        },
    )
    return resp
```

